Date: Fri, 23 Jan 2026 10:40:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] render/gles2/shaders: use templates and a perlscript to
 generate the fragment shaders

---
 render/gles2/shaders/quad.frag               | 14 ++++++++++----
 render/gles2/shaders/templ/1.sh              |  1 +
